# Local lieutenant additions

This file is this forge's own. The composer seeds it once, when there is nothing
here yet, and never writes it again - so whatever the operator wants their
lieutenant to do that is true here and nowhere else belongs here, and survives
every update.

It is read after `swarmforge/roles/lieutenant.prompt`, which refers to it: that
file is the shared operating manual, replaced on each update, and this one adds
to it rather than repeating it.

Nothing here yet.
